{"data": [{"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:53:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113478957735858478"], "id": "2113478957735858478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 893, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "兄弟们早盘速报：三大指数集体低开下探，沪指午收跌1.2%失守3650，创业板9连跌，但300ETF放量托底、机器人独苗逆势封板\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113478957735858478"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:42:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114004633740009868"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zhishuzengzhan…", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113535759705633118", "start": 120, "url": "https://t.co/xyGV9F5tvr"}]}, "id": "2114004633740009868", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 3123, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113535759705633118", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A股市场的食物链：都在亏，那么到底谁赚了？\n\n创业板指：6月25日高点约4380点 → 10月22日约2577点，回撤约41%，已回到“924行情”附近。⁠\n\n沪深300：较6月高点回撤约20%。\n\n上证指数：较年内高点回撤约14%左右。 https://t.co/xyGV9F5tvr", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2114004633740009868"}, {"author_id": "1453893287606034438", "created_at": "2026-10-24T15:05:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114010491257540896"], "id": "2114010491257540896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 330, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "本周A股复盘\n\n（10.19–10.23，周一至周五）\n \n核心一句话总结：本周是典型“恐慌杀跌→分歧煎熬→周五深V逆转”的震荡修复周，主线AI算力链经历一轮剧烈情绪杀，周五靠龙头澄清+ETF抄底资金完成日内大修复；板块轮动极快，题材高度压缩，退潮期特征明显，反弹还不能直接判定趋势反转。", "url": "https://x.com/717171David/status/2114010491257540896"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113801026117771264", "3_2113801026121912320"]}, "author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-10-24T01:13:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113801037605966140"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 15, "start": 11, "tag": "国家队"}, {"end": 28, "start": 22, "tag": "宽基ETF"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/I3JMb91WXc", "end": 127, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2113801037605966140/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113801026117771264", "start": 104, "url": "https://t.co/I3JMb91WXc"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/I3JMb91WXc", "end": 127, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2113801037605966140/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113801026121912320", "start": 104, "url": "https://t.co/I3JMb91WXc"}]}, "id": "2113801037605966140", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10月23日（周五），#国家队 相关的9只 #宽基ETF 成交额合计约840亿元人民币，创今年7月20日以来新高，是当天A股从早盘大跌（盘中一度跌超3%）走出深V反弹的重要资金信号之一。\n关键数据与背景\n• https://t.co/I3JMb91WXc", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2113801037605966140"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113868465262276608"]}, "author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-24T05:41:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113868479866765734"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oQqr2WVF2M", "end": 153, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113868479866765734/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113868465262276608", "start": 130, "url": "https://t.co/oQqr2WVF2M"}]}, "id": "2113868479866765734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股逆势大涨，创业板指涨4.16%\n\n· 上证指数收3690.48点涨0.89%，深成指涨2.79%，创业板指涨4.16%领涨\n· 与隔夜美股形成背离：道指跌1.23%、标普跌0.52%、纳指跌0.21%\n· 宽基ETF现历史天量，资金借道指数大举进场\n\n📌 https://t.co/oQqr2WVF2M", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113868479866765734"}, {"author_id": "2062811475446779905", "created_at": "2026-10-23T10:24:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113577181452677207"], "id": "2113577181452677207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 160, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📈 10.23 复盘｜早盘失守 3600，午后 V 转收 3690，两市放量到 1.96 万亿，4526 家上涨。群里怕是又牛来速回了吧哈哈哈哈\n\n【量能】\n两市成交 19,563 亿，比昨天多 4,276 亿（+28%）。站上了 1.8 万亿门槛，而且是放量上涨，跟昨天的放量下跌性质完全不同。\n多只宽基 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/Leodozqa/status/2113577181452677207"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113478470072487936"]}, "author_id": "829980811", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:54:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113479182386962737"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/N8U7em1pd1", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/shenrenlaile66/status/2113479182386962737/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113478470072487936", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/N8U7em1pd1"}]}, "id": "2113479182386962737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "截至午盘收盘上证下跌-1.2%，抵达3614.12，最低抵达3574.27，原因如下：\n三重压力共振导致普跌外部冲击：美债10Y收益率高位维持5%以上，压制全球高估值成长股估值地缘风险推升油价突破111美元，强化通胀担忧和加息预期亚太科技股联动下跌，日韩半导体龙头领跌，直接拖累A股AI硬件链 https://t.co/N8U7em1pd1", "url": "https://x.com/shenrenlaile66/status/2113479182386962737"}, {"author_id": "1978744913803227136", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113476074952953947"], "id": "2113476074952953947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "救市啦！", "url": "https://x.com/jixyStar/status/2113476074952953947"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113495432861306880"]}, "author_id": "1989322594286522368", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:59:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113495463710302554"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/F76VAGQmms", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CiaraJerem37771/status/2113495463710302554/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113495432861306880", "start": 178, "url": "https://t.co/F76VAGQmms"}]}, "id": "2113495463710302554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "仅半个交易日，股票型ETF成交额超1248亿元，昨日全天为1888亿元，宽基型ETF成交额突破785亿元，昨日全天为1226亿。其中创业板ETF易方达（159915）成交额95亿、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞（510300）成交额89亿、科创50ETF华夏（588000）成交额72亿。中证1000ETF南方（512100）成交额逼近昨日全天成交额，沪深30 https://t.co/F76VAGQmms", "url": "https://x.com/CiaraJerem37771/status/2113495463710302554"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113622309865213953"]}, "author_id": "154574316", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:23:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113622316810977579"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y9UnGo1TPF", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2113622316810977579/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113622309865213953", "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/Y9UnGo1TPF"}]}, "id": "2113622316810977579", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 6796, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "10月23日，创业板ETF易方达成交197亿元，为上市以来历史第三高，仅次于2024年10月8日和9日；\n\n沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞、科创50ETF华夏成交额均超过150亿元。 https://t.co/Y9UnGo1TPF", "url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2113622316810977579"}, {"author_id": "860407503150043136", "created_at": "2026-10-24T05:27:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113864879052664975"], "id": "2113864879052664975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 808, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "埃斯顿AH联袂涨停 工业机器人龙头的两市场共振\n\n29.18元，涨9.99%，尾盘封板。$埃斯顿(sz002747)$昨天的涨停，叠着H股大涨16%、本周5天4升。 AH联袂的共振，把工业机器人 龙头的热度推到了台前。  一、涨停的数字", "url": "https://x.com/CludioMoreira13/status/2113864879052664975"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-23T06:37:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113520102348050729"], "id": "2113520102348050729", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 26609, "like_count": 82, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "这是护盘，但手法和十月上半月不一样。此前10月上半月出现的几次护盘操作，大多是直接瞄准几只市值最高的头部权重蓝筹个股拉抬指数，覆盖的标的范围非常窄，市场感知度并不高，这次直接从ETF产品端入手，操作路径和覆盖范围都和之前有明显区别。创业板ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113520102348050729"}, {"author_id": "1579345963973365763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113427686064308695"], "id": "2113427686064308695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 259, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "昨日A股市场尾盘，宽基ETF异动。\n\n昨日，上证指数在3700点附近徘徊多日后，再次失守。最低到达3649点，月内第二次创下一年内新低。 ETF市场再次出现尾盘异动情况。多只宽基ETF成交额骤然放量。沪深300", "url": "https://x.com/lili103103/status/2113427686064308695"}, {"author_id": "2107614698233344001", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:47:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113537712170881295"], "id": "2113537712170881295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 451, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10.23 A股 午盘分析\n\n果然A股集体反弹，今天可以说是绝处逢生，成交额放量4300多亿，有资金开始入场了，短期可以喘口气了，接下来主要说几点：\n\n1、今天A股为何能够绝处逢生？以下这些数据成为关键：\n\n（1）一是两市放量4310亿元，今天可以说是放量探底回升，明显的放量是缓解当前流动性危机的关键；", "url": "https://x.com/Savingrko/status/2113537712170881295"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113485326442528768"]}, "author_id": "2107614698233344001", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:19:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113485333296009704"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sKUQhF3S7G", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Savingrko/status/2113485333296009704/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113485326442528768", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/sKUQhF3S7G"}]}, "id": "2113485333296009704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 403, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10.23 A股 早盘分析及下午看法\n\n一边杀科技，一边拉金融和消费，今天这是要开始保指数了！今天指数收出下影线的概率较高，但要看会有多少资金跟风进场，主要说几点：\n\n1、为什么说今天A股指数收出下影线的可能性较大？\n\n一是从开盘一小时来看，沪深300ETF的放量已经超越了昨天全天。 https://t.co/sKUQhF3S7G", "url": "https://x.com/Savingrko/status/2113485333296009704"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113648241501786112"]}, "author_id": "1321270432385896448", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:13:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113649911652585976"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cDH1G2Avq8", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2113649911652585976/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113648241501786112", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/cDH1G2Avq8"}]}, "id": "2113649911652585976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 9783, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "🔥今天A股的深V反转，到底是请君入瓮，还是真正反转？\n\n我看到有小伙伴说：“今天A股下午爆拉3.49%，就为了骗你进场，这镰刀都抡冒烟了！ 太绝了！大A的套路真是万年不变。”\n\n因为他看到8小时前的大盘净流出 162.5亿元，而我看到同花顺的现在大盘数据显示：净流出 25.37亿元。 https://t.co/cDH1G2Avq8", "url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2113649911652585976"}, {"author_id": "1305374184", "created_at": "2026-10-24T05:11:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113861021454774286"], "id": "2113861021454774286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "投资者对人工智能（AI）投资和企业盈利的担忧，加剧了科技股的抛售潮。分析认为，持续的消费低迷印证中国经济前景堪忧，中国大陆股市步入熊市。\n\n大陆股市连日下跌，失守3700点关口。10月23日，上证指数收报3690.48点，沪深两市合计成交额1.5万亿元（人民币，下同），较年内最高的单日成交额缩水过半。", "url": "https://x.com/s_hxxtn/status/2113861021454774286"}, {"author_id": "1728697577049317376", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:15:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113529743912108121"], "id": "2113529743912108121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 312, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股三大指数今日集体上涨，截至收盘，上证指数涨0.89%，深证成指涨2.79%，创业板指涨4.16%，北证50涨1.88%，科创50指数涨3.04%。全市场成交额19728亿元，较上日放量4310亿元，全市场超4500只个股上涨", "url": "https://x.com/LukeBitMarathon/status/2113529743912108121"}, {"author_id": "1609897027709861888", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:28:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113668915549397321"], "entities": {